Source: hml-reimagined-theme
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: HML Reimagined Team <hml@reimagined.dev>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/hml-reimagined

Package: hml-reimagined-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, breeze, plasma-workspace
Recommends: hml-reimagined-sounds, hml-reimagined-wallpapers, hml-reimagined-control-center
Description: HML Reimagined desktop theme
 Complete desktop theming package for HML Reimagined Linux.
 Includes KDE Plasma theme, color schemes, GTK themes, icon theme,
 cursor theme, SDDM login theme, GRUB theme, and Plymouth boot splash.

Package: hml-reimagined-sounds
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: HML Reimagined sound theme
 System sound theme for HML Reimagined Linux.
 Includes notification, login/logout, and UI interaction sounds.

Package: hml-reimagined-wallpapers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: HML Reimagined wallpaper collection
 Wallpaper packs for HML Reimagined Linux.
 Includes Classic, Modern, and Dark Glam variants in 4K and 1080p.

Package: hml-reimagined-control-center
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-pyqt6
Description: HML Control Center
 Theme and customization manager for HML Reimagined Linux.
 Switch between modes, toggle sounds, change wallpapers, and more.

